<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In Him I see the Godhead shine,</l><l>Christ for me, Christ for me;</l><l>He is the majesty divine,</l><l>Christ for me, Christ for me;</l><l>The Father’s well-beloved Son,</l><l>Co-partner of His royal throne,</l><l>Who bore the guilt of man alone,</l><l>Christ for me, Christ for me.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Let others boast of heaps of gold,</l><l>Christ for me, Christ for me;</l><l>His riches never can be told,</l><l>Christ for me, Christ for me;</l><l>Your gold will waste and wear away,</l><l>Your honors perish in a day;</l><l>My portion never can decay,</l><l>Christ for me, Christ for me.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>In pining sickness, or in health,</l><l>Christ for me, Christ for me;</l><l>In deepest poverty or wealth,</l><l>Christ for me, Christ for me;</l><l>And in that all-important day,</l><l>When I the summons must obey,</l><l>And pass from this dark world away,</l><l>Christ for me, Christ for me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
